    ns1:description """Galaxy is an open, web-based platform for accessible, reproducible, and transparent computational biological research.\r
\r
* **Accessible**: Users can easily run tools without writing code or using the CLI; all via a user-friendly web interface.\r
* **Reproducible**: Galaxy captures all the metadata from an analysis, making it completely reproducible.\r
* **Transparent**: Users share and publish analyses via interactive pages that can enhance analyses with user annotations.\r
* **Scalable**: Galaxy can run on anything, from a laptop, to large clusters, to the cloud\r
\r
\r
""" ;
