\r
If you would like to contribute to this pipeline, please see the [contributing guidelines](.github/CONTRIBUTING.md).\r
\r
For further information or help, don't hesitate to get in touch on the [Slack `#sarek` channel](https://nfcore.slack.com/channels/sarek) (you can join with [this invite](https://nf-co.re/join/slack)), or contact us: [Maxime U Garcia](mailto:maxime.garcia@seqera.io?subject=[GitHub]%20nf-core/sarek), [Friederike Hanssen](mailto:friederike.hanssen@qbic.uni-tuebingen.de?subject=[GitHub]%20nf-core/sarek)\r
