    ns1:description """# AMBER Protein MD Setup tutorials using BioExcel Building Blocks (biobb)\r
\r
**Based on the official [GROMACS tutorial](http://www.mdtutorials.com/gmx/lysozyme/index.html).**\r
\r
***\r
\r
This tutorial aims to illustrate the process of **setting up a simulation** system containing a **protein**, step by step, using the **BioExcel Building Blocks library (biobb)** wrapping the **Ambertools MD package**.\r
\r
