    ns1:dateModified "2023-01-16T13:51:47Z"^^ns1:Date ;
    ns1:description """Workflow for quality assessment of paired reads and classification using NGTax 2.0 and functional annotation using picrust2. \r
In addition files are exported to their respective subfolders for easier data management in a later stage.\r
Steps:  \r
    - FastQC (read quality control)\r
    - NGTax 2.0\r
    - Picrust 2\r
    - Export module for ngtax\r
""" ;
