    ns1:description """Galaxy workflow example that illustrate the process of setting up a simulation system containing a protein, step by step, using the [BioExcel Building Blocks](/projects/11) library (biobb). The particular example used is the Lysozyme protein (PDB code 1AKI). This workflow returns a resulting protein structure and simulated 3D trajectories.\r
\r
Designed for running on the https://dev.usegalaxy.es Galaxy instance.""" ;
    ns1:isPartOf <https://workflowhub.eu/collections/3> ;
