## Acknowledgements\r
\r
The workflow &amp; the [doc_guidelines template used](https://github.com/AustralianBioCommons/doc_guidelines) are supported by the Australian BioCommons via Bioplatforms Australia funding, the Australian Research Data Commons (https://doi.org/10.47486/PL105) and the Queensland Government RICF programme. Bioplatforms Australia and the Australian Research Data Commons are enabled by the National Collaborative Research Infrastructure Strategy (NCRIS).\r
""" ;
