        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/357#generic_variant_calling_wgs_pe_main-outputs-SnpEff%20eff:%20stats>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/357#generic_variant_calling_wgs_pe_main-outputs-SnpEff%20variants>,
