    ns1:description """Amplicon analysis workflow using NG-Tax\r
\r
**Steps:**\r
\r
* Quality control on the reads\r
* Execute NGTax for ASV detection and classification\r
\r
For more information about NG-Tax 2.0 have a look at https://doi.org/10.3389/fgene.2019.01366""" ;
