    ns1:description """Take a scRNAseq counts matrix from a single sample, and perform basic QC with scanpy. Then, do further processing by making a UMAP and clustering. Produces a processed AnnData \r
object.\r
\r
Depreciated: use individual workflows insead for multiple samples""" ;
