    ns1:description """The simplest workflow among a collection of workflows intended to solve tasks up to CTF estimation.\r
\r
**Basic processing pipeline**\r
\r
* Import movies\r
\r
* Movie alignment (recommended 2 GPUs)\r
\r
* CTF estimation\r
\r
**Monitor acquisition**\r
\r
* Monitor summary protocol: \r
	* Monitor basic parameters (item counts, drift, resolution, astigmatism, defocus, etc.)\r
	* Raise alarms (mail setting available)\r
	* Provides information of the basic steps (html report)""" ;
