**License Agreement**: Apache2  \r
**Platform**: COMPSs  \r
**Machine**: MareNostrum4  \r
\r
TruncatedSVD (Randomized SVD) for computing just 456 singular values out of a (3.6M x 1200) size matrix.  \r
The input matrix represents a CFD transient simulation of aire moving past a cylinder.  \r
This application used [dislib-0.9.0](https://github.com/bsc-wdc/dislib/tree/release-0.9)\r
""" ;
