    ns1:dateCreated "2024-04-23T02:02:06Z"^^ns1:Date ;
    ns1:dateModified "2024-06-14T01:01:31Z"^^ns1:Date ;
    ns1:description """# Scaffolding with Bionano

Scaffolding using Bionano optical map data

## Inputs

1. Bionano data [cmap]
2. Estimated genome size [txt]
3. Phased assembly generated by Hifiasm [gfa1]

## Outputs

1. Scaffolds
2. Non-scaffolded contigs
3. QC: Assembly statistics
4. QC: Nx plot
5. QC: Size plot""" ;
