| Drosophila melanogaster    | 143M        | 14,753  | 57,343  | 14,499 | diptera       | C:96.1%[S:95.6%,D:0.5%],F:1.2%,M:2.7%   | melanogaster subgroup, C:90.38%[S:84.32%,D:6.06%],M:9.62%,,n:12442 | A:94.21%[P:4.05%,F:7.28%],I:1.61%[P:0.5%,F:0.42%],C:0.00%[P:0.00%,F:0.00%],U:4.19%      |\r
