\r
## Future work\r
- Python wrapper function to remove intermediate files\r
- Adding functional annotation with `Interproscan` and `eggnog`\r
- Adding PASA results to further improve the accuracy of the training\r
- Adding custom parameter for both `BRAKER` and `funannotate`""" ;
