    ns1:description """Galaxy Workflow created on Galaxy-E european instance, ecology.usegalaxy.eu, related to the Galaxy training tutorial "[Champs blocs](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/ecology/tutorials/champs-blocs/tutorial.html)" .\r
