\r
For further information or help, don't hesitate to get in touch on the [Slack `#pipelines` channel](https://sangertreeoflife.slack.com/channels/pipelines). Please [create an issue](https://github.com/sanger-tol/readmapping/issues/new/choose) on GitHub if you are not on the Sanger slack channel.\r
\r
