    ns1:description """**Name:** Lanczos SVD  \r
**Contact Person**: support-compss@bsc.es  \r
**Access Level**: public  \r
**License Agreement**: Apache2  \r
**Platform**: COMPSs  \r
**Machine**: MareNostrum4  \r
\r
Lanczos SVD for computing singular values needed to reach an epsilon of 1e-3 on a matrix of (150000, 150).  \r
The input matrix is generated synthetically.  \r
This application used [dislib-0.9.0](https://github.com/bsc-wdc/dislib/tree/release-0.9)\r
""" ;
