    ns1:description """Workflow for NonSpliced RNAseq data with multiple aligners.\r
\r
Steps:  \r
    - workflow_quality.cwl:\r
        - FastQC (control)\r
        - fastp (trimming)\r
    - bowtie2 (read mapping)\r
    - sam_to_sorted-bam\r
    - featurecounts (transcript read counts)\r
    - kallisto (transcript [pseudo]counts)\r
""" ;
