\r
If you use the pipeline, please cite our bioarxiv preprint: https://doi.org/10.1101/2023.08.11.552985\r
\r
Since the pipeline is a wrapper for several other bioinformatic tools we also ask that you cite the tools used by the pipeline:\r
 - Fastqc https://github.com/s-andrews/FastQC\r
 - Fastp https://doi.org/10.1093/bioinformatics/bty560\r
 - GetOrganelle https://doi.org/10.1186/s13059-020-02154-5\r
 - Blastn https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-2105-10-421\r
 - Minimap2 https://doi.org/10.1093/bioinformatics/bty191\r
 - Blobtools https://doi.org/10.12688/f1000research.12232.1\r
 - Seqkit https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0163962\r
 - MITOS2 https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ympev.2012.08.023\r
 - Gblocks (default) https://doi.org/10.1093/oxfordjournals.molbev.a026334\r
 - Clipkit (optional) https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001007\r
 - Mafft https://doi.org/10.1093/molbev/mst010\r
 - Iqtree https://doi.org/10.1093/molbev/msu300\r
 - ete3 https://doi.org/10.1093/molbev/msw046\r
 - ggtree https://doi.org/10.1111/2041-210X.12628\r
\r
