    ns1:description """**Name:** Matmul GPU Case 1 Cache-OFF  \r
**Contact Person**: cristian.tatu@bsc.es  \r
**Access Level**: public  \r
**License Agreement**: Apache2  \r
**Platform**: COMPSs 3.3  \r
**Machine**: Minotauro-MN4  \r
\r
Matmul running on the GPU without Cache.  \r
Launched using 32 GPUs (16 nodes).  \r
Performs C = A @ B  \r
Where A: shape (320, 56_900_000)  block_size (10, 11_380_000)  \r
            B: shape (56_900_000, 10)      block_size (11_380_000, 10)  \r
            C: shape (320, 10)                                 block_size (10, 10)  \r
Total dataset size 291 GB.  \r
Version dislib-0.9\r
\r
Average task execution time: 56 seconds\r
""" ;
