    ns1:dateCreated "2024-04-19T08:57:59Z"^^ns1:Date ;
    ns1:dateModified "2024-04-21T15:20:13Z"^^ns1:Date ;
    ns1:description """**Name:** Incrementation and Fibonacci     \r
**Access Level**: public  \r
**License Agreement**: Apache2  \r
**Platform**: COMPSs  \r
\r
# Description\r
**Brief Overview:** Demonstrates COMPSs task parallelism with increment and Fibonacci computations. Helps to understand COMPSs.\r
\r
**Detailed Description:**\r
 1. Performs multiple increments of input values in parallel using COMPSs.\r
 2. Concurrently calculates Fibonacci numbers using recursive COMPSs tasks.\r
 3. Demonstrates task synchronization via `compss_wait_on`.\r
\r
# Execution instructions\r
Usage:\r
```\r
runcompss src/increment_fibonacci.py value1 Value2 Value3 \r
#add more values if you want\r
\r
```\r
\r
# Execution Examples\r
```\r
runcompss src/increment_fibonacci.py 1 4 3 9 6 9 \r
\r
```\r
\r
# Build\r
No build is required\r
""" ;
