<https://workflowhub.eu/programmes/33> a ns1:FundingScheme ;
    dcterms:conformsTo "https://schema.org/FundingScheme" ;
    ns1:description """Welcome to the ERGA Space!\r
\r
Here we collect, curate and develop pipelines to assemble and annotation reference-quality genomes for all eukaryotic life.\r
\r
For Genome Assembly pipelines head to our [Assembly Team](https://workflowhub.eu/projects/163)\r
\r
For Genome Annotation pipelines head to our [Annotation Team](https://workflowhub.eu/projects/191)\r
\r
Development, discussions and issue tracking takes place in the [ERGA github repo](https://github.com/eRGA-consortium/pipelines/)\r
\r
If you would like to join our journey, why not [become an ERGA member](https://www.erga-biodiversity.eu/register) to join one of our committees and be kept up to date with our developments.\r
\r
We aim to democratise the task of reference genome generation for all life.""" ;
    ns1:image <https://workflowhub.eu/programmes/33/avatars/213?size=250> ;
    ns1:logo <https://workflowhub.eu/assets/avatar-images/213-200x200.png> ;
    ns1:name "ERGA" ;
    ns1:url <https://www.erga-biodiversity.eu/> .

