    ns1:description """Collection of workflows designed to assembled a set of PacBio HiFi and Illumina HiC reads into a chromosome-scale _de-novo_ assembly.\r
\r
Development versions of these pipelines can be found in the [ERGA github](https://github.com/ERGA-consortium/pipelines) and any questions or queries can be raised on the [ERGA Discussions Channel](https://github.com/ERGA-consortium/pipelines/discussions)\r
\r
Want to find out more about the work done by ERGA? [Become a member](https://www.erga-biodiversity.eu/register) and join one of our monthly open [Committee Meetings](https://www.erga-biodiversity.eu/community-contacts).""" ;
