    ns1:description """A set of **generic** and **automatic workflows** designed to: \r
\r
* Run on-the-fly and unattended.\r
\r
* Maintain robust stability for a wide range of samples.\r
\r
* Covers steps from movies to CTF estimation (for the moment).\r
\r
* Monitor the acquisition process and provide user feedback.\r
\r
* Comprise three proposed workflows, each with an additional layer of complexity.""" ;
