    ns1:description """Collection of de-novo genome assembly workflows written for implementation in Galaxy\r
\r
Input data should be PacBio HiFi reads and Illumina 3-dimensional Chromatin Confirmation Capture (HiC) reads\r
\r
Executing all workflows will output two scaffolded haplotype assemblies and the complete QC analyses\r
\r
Please run the workflows in order: WF0 (there are two, one for HiFi and one for Illumina HiC), WF1, WF2, WF3, WF4""" ;
