<https://workflowhub.eu/projects/181> a ns1:Organization,
        ns1:Project ;
    dcterms:conformsTo "https://schema.org/Project" ;
    ns1:description """Provide an integrated, comprehensive, modular modelling and testing framework\r
\r
Develop multi-scale workflows applicable beyond the identified test-areas enabling improved physical understanding and progress beyond state-of-the-art in the earthquake process.\r
\r
Develop and implement 6 DTCs covering earthquake-related aspects over long and short time scales\r
\r
Test the 6 DTC-E at 4 relevant sites: Euro-Med (SD8), Central Apennines and Alto-Tiberina (SD9), Bedretto Lab (SD10) and the Alps (SD11).""" ;
